; HostFiles (type kind 22, service kind 6) and its Linux-binding primitives,
; spelled as integers: 9 load, 14 system_chunk, 20 system_identity. They are
; admitted only in functions of module aurora.host (native names
; __au_<mode>_m2_6aurora4host_...). The memory primitives 21..28 (23
; unmap_memory, 24 memory_load, 27 memory_store8) belong to aurora.memory
; (__au_<mode>_m2_6aurora6memory_...) and are emitted only for a hosted entry
; that takes a region. The Aurora kernel binding's primitives 29 kernel_print
; and 30 kernel_chunk and 31 kernel_file belong to aurora.host under --target
; aurora (RUN ... aurora) and the Linux ones 13..28 only to the default Linux
; target; the session primitives 9..12 serve both.

; CASE: accepted host primitives
; RUN: emit
; CHECK: syscall
; CHECK-NOT: __au_runtime_
; RUN: stack-facts
; CHECK-JSON: functions.__au_v_m2_6aurora4host_n1_4host_d8identity.calls {"__au_linux_system_call":64}
function __au_v_m2_6aurora4host_n1_4host_d8identity
  result i64
  params [22]
  frame 32
  service 16
    BindServiceParameter 0 16 6
    ServiceOperation 16 20 0 6
    Return
end
